    "details": "Jenkins Security Advisory 2026-10-28:\n\n> - (High) SECURITY-4125 / CVE-2026-117612: RCE vulnerability in XStream\n>   deserialization due to improper resolves-to attribute handling\n> - (High) SECURITY-4225 / CVE-2026-117613: Collection element type\n>   check bypass vulnerability\n> - (High) SECURITY-4123 / CVE-2026-117614: Agent launch command\n>   approval bypass vulnerability\n> - (High) SECURITY-4187 / CVE-2026-117615: Link following vulnerability\n>   allows arbitrary file read\n> - (High) SECURITY-4188 / CVE-2026-117616: Path traversal vulnerability\n>   in agent names\n> - (High) SECURITY-4248 / CVE-2026-117617: Race condition in artifact\n>   extraction allows arbitrary file creation\n> - (High) SECURITY-4232 / CVE-2026-117621: XSS vulnerability in\n>   workspace browser\n> - (High) SECURITY-4249 / CVE-2026-117622: XSS vulnerability in\n>   handling of agent errors\n> - (High) SECURITY-4229 / CVE-2026-117623: Stored XSS vulnerability in\n>   breadcrumb bar overflow menu\n> - (High) SECURITY-4122 / CVE-2026-117618: Race condition in setup\n>   wizard allows creating an administrator account\n> - (High) SECURITY-4189 / CVE-2026-117619: Insufficient session\n>   expiration vulnerability\n> - (High) SECURITY-4226 / CVE-2026-117620: Old Data Monitor injection\n>   lets users take over administrator accounts\n> - (High) SECURITY-4243 / CVE-2026-117624: Root element restriction\n>   bypass in XStream deserialization\n> - (Medium) SECURITY-4206 / CVE-2026-117625: Missing permission check\n>   allows obtaining HTTP proxy configuration\n> - (Medium) SECURITY-4237 / CVE-2026-117626: Path traversal\n>   vulnerability in file browser\n",
